  "2026-05-31T20:31:06.275Z",codex-audit-20260531,"Evidence: specialists found no immediate SDK/package, CLI/perf, or tracker-structure blockers. Fixed release docs to match the Sentry token requirement. Backfilled branch-local closed item resolution metadata, reducing validation warnings from 69 to 29 historical rows with history drift still ok. Local gates passed: pnpm build; pm health summary ok; secret scan ok; package-first dogfood ok; semantic package-first dogfood ok with qwen3-embedding:0.6b; required Sentry/telemetry gate ok with zero critical/high and telemetry error rate 1.23%; release run-gates ok including 2068 tests and 100% coverage."
